    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Introducing No 11 Altamont Hall, Dundrum. Available for sale exclusively through Lynam Auctioneers, this bright and spacious 2 bed apartment is well presented throughout and offers the discerning purchaser the opportunity to own a turnkey property in a highly sought after location.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 87sqm, No 11 Altamont Hall is ideally located within a mature residential development just off Stoney Road in Dundrum. Accommodation comprises a welcoming and spacious entrance hall with timber flooring  leading to a light filled living and kitchen area. The kitchen is modern, fully equipped and offers plenty of storage. No. 11 boasts a separate utility room off the kitchen also. \r\n\r\nThere is timber flooring throughout creating a sense of warmth and continuity. This property has  2 well appointed bedrooms, the large master bedroom boasting a separate en suite bathroom. This room also features a spacious dressing area with built in wardrobes.  Accommodation is completed by a family bathroom with a bath.\r\n\r\nCombining tranquility in the mature development of Altamont Hall with quality interiors and local amenities, No 11 Altamont Hall is a fantastic purchase opportunity in the heart of Dundrum.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing advised.\r\n\r\n*2 x bedroom photos digitally designed*"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious, well appointed 2 bedroom 2 bathroom apartment\r\nUtility room\r\nDedicated parking space\r\nRefurbished bathrooms incuding a new pump installed \r\nNew electric radiators installed \r\n10 minute walk to the LUAS at Dundrum\r\nFantastic variety of local amenities"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
